Kerstin (de_DE-kerstin-medium), a Piper voice

Trained on CC0 recordings (MODEL_CARD), fine-tuned from Piper's hifi_tts_92 base model: the voice of Cori Samuel, a
volunteer reader for LibriVox (https://librivox.org), trained on her recordings in the Hi-Fi Multi-Speaker English
TTS Dataset by NVIDIA Corporation (Bakhturina, Lavrukhin, Ginsburg and Zhang, "Hi-Fi Multi-Speaker English TTS
Dataset", Interspeech 2021, https://www.openslr.org/109/), which is licensed under CC BY 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. The voice is a model trained from those recordings, not the
recordings themselves. The model is under the MIT licence beside this file.
